{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">高盛：LandMark硅光子增长强劲，产能扩张至2028年</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS在最新报告中更新了对台湾光通信组件厂LandMark（3081.TWO）的判断。核心信号很直接：硅光子（SiPh）业务已经从增长故事变成实实在在的业绩引擎，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>数据中心相关收入占比达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">85%</span>，公司毛利率同步跳升。而在于它把一家公司的产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>节奏、产品结构变化和下游AI需求放在同一个时间轴上。LandMark二季度营收新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.21亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">121%</span>，净利润同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">384%</span>至4.68亿元，均超出GS和彭博一致预期。毛利率57.5%，比去年同期高出14.2个百分点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXUZxdicetIGTc3eM5U1kQEYpVRlll0MlktycMEicpN8Z2HBnE9Ir1mhn5kB3uRSvGM0gI90zIxHibyuHms0FsFYyibtNmbYwVKeNM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率跳升来自规模效应与产品结构</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看数字。LandMark二季度毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">57.5%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54.8%</span>，去年同期只有<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43.3%</span>。GS认为，这主要来自更大的生产规模和更好的产品组合。数据中心收入占比已经达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">85%</span>，其中硅光子是主要收入来源。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把这件事拆开看，毛利率提升不是单靠涨价，而是高毛利产品在收入盘子里的权重变大了。硅光子产品对应的AI数据中心需求，比传统电信光模块的盈利能力更强。当这类产品从“补充”变成“主力”，整体毛利率自然上一个台阶。报告预计<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">三季度</span>及以后硅光子收入还会继续增长，支撑来自产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>和客户需求。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong>KC评论：</strong> 先看毛利率从<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">43.3%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">57.5%</span>这个跳跃，它比营收增速更能说明产品结构的变化。简单说，营收增长可能靠量，毛利率跳升则意味着高价值产品占比在快速提高；后续更值得观察的是毛利率能否在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">55%</span>以上稳住，而不是单季冲高后回落。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVic1U9xC35hkGia4UIia4sCiaoJVMw577hGsAEOhxNPUMo3dg3VkF9CV2SHZzaF14QnMZkspHxgQfXOmZBAXKQCVSSKR7I0aHoVbg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>计划延续至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>，设备采购先行</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层给出的产能指引是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>产能同比增长达到三位数。6月中旬，LandMark公告从Aixtron采购设备，总价值约新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.37亿元</span>，用于支持InP外延晶圆和CW激光器的产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这里的<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">关键是</span>设备采购与产能爬坡之间的时间差。现在买设备，对应的是未来两年的产出能力。GS在报告中把硅光子收入贡献的预测一路排到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2032年</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>预计占<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">88%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">93%</span>，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2028年</span>以后维持在96%左右。这意味着公司未来的增长几乎完全押注在硅光子一条线上。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">7月营收已经验证了需求端的强度。LandMark 7月营收新台币<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.01亿元</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">177%</span>，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">19%</span>，比GS此前预期高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14%</span>。GS将增长归因于800G和1.6T硅光子光模块的强劲需求、更好的InP衬底供应，以及公司自身的产能<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWmxnLlNoQTEP4jj27NOt52xBnrgkmwyLbO74XkwVuiaf1CUciaPYAV8MQq8ic5bCs3fY52Eaw1Foib19fjOAtk9wv0TiaicOia8972yM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. 盈利预测上调集中在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>，毛利率预期同步<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span></h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">GS将<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2029年</span>的盈利预测分别上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>和<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，主要反映硅光子CW激光器收入增加。毛利率预测在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至2029年间上调0.2至0.7个百分点，理由是产品组合改善和规模扩大。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">注意</span>上调幅度的分布。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026年</span>盈利预测上调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4%</span>，明显高于后面几年的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，这说明报告认为近期增长动能更强，远期反而相对平稳。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVfbRtdprIJNiaq0wF02ea4FoI8CK6tTprKYNJlOLlbgW5NlXvibdE42h9KkQ8L3Qic6wnRiaWQH9aXJIXibAiaomqbibnB1BSdN224Wc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 32-GS-LandMark -3081.TWO-- SiPh in strong growth- Capacity strong expansion through 2028- July - 2Q26 beat</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
